[Lemma L4 of arXiv:2608.22945, 'A Momentum-Based Variance-Reduced Algorithm for Federated Multiobjective Optimization'] Suppose that Assumptions (A1 of the paper)--(A2 of the paper) hold. If $\eta L K \leq 1$ and $24e^2(\eta L)^4K^4+24\eta^2L^2K\leq \frac{1}{2}$, then
	\begin{align*}
		U_s^t \leq 4 e^2 K^2 \Xi_s^t+12(\eta K)^2\left(8(\eta K L)^2+K^{-1}\right)\left(\beta^2 \sigma^2+4(\gamma L)^2 \mathbb{E}[\|g^{t-1}\|^2]\right).
	\end{align*}

