Using the generating functions of $\stirling{n}{k}$ and $\stirlingb{n}{k}$, we obtain
\[
\sum_{\ell=0}^n \stirling{n}{\ell}2^{n-\ell}(1+t)^\ell
=(t+1)(t+3)\cdots(t+2n-1)
=\sum_{r=0}^n \stirlingb{n}{r}t^r.
\]
Hence, by $[t^j] \frac{t^r}{1+t} = (-1)^{j-r}$ for $j\geq r$ (the coefficient equals $0$ for $j<r$), we ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:e0c9eb10bb328148436f2ae8536d20d1a42b2d0c6fea4dc5e2c679ca70541b77","revision_digest":"sha256:cc506358d401ba8485c2e4c484d9f9abaa66f7f5581878083fb5c1b1791c290b","source_id":"arxiv:2608.16752","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

