[Definition 67 (Level sets of $\newuL \upmu$ and the $\newuL \upmu$-adapted tori) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] Given a non-negative number $\ubar' \le 0$, we define:
	\begin{subequations}
