[Lem ;lpdefp of arXiv:2604.12462, 'Stochastic analysis of Beckner's and related functional inequalities'] The function $\fp $ satisfies the equation 
\begin{align}
 \frac{\partial \fp }{\partial s}(s,x)x^{2p-4}+\frac{1}{2}\frac{\partial ^{2}\fp }{\partial x^{2}}(s,x)
 =x^{-p}s,\quad s,x>0,
\end{align}
with initial condition $\fp (0,x)=0$ for $x>0$.

