[Definition 1 (Bulk contour statistic) of arXiv:2608.07820, 'Linear Spectral Statistics for Entrywise-Transformed Spiked Wigner Matrices under Shifted '] Let \(A\) be a real symmetric matrix and let \(\varphi\) be analytic on a
neighborhood of \(\overline{D_\Gamma}\).  Define
\begin{equation}
 \mathcal L_A^\Gamma(\varphi)
 :=\sum_{j=1}^N
 \varphi(\lambda_j(A))\one_{\{\lambda_j(A)\in D_\Gamma\}}.
\end{equation}
If \(\spec(A)\cap\Gamma=\varnothing\), then
\begin{equation}
 \mathcal L_A^\Gamma(\varphi)
 =-\frac{1}{2\pi\ii}
 \oint_\Gamma
 \varphi(z)\Tr(A-zI)^{-1}\,\dd z.
\end{equation}

