which shows that $\exp\{-\hat{R}_n(ct-\sum_{i=0}^{V_t^{(n)}}\xi_i)\}$ is integrable. Furthermore, for any $0<s<t$, we have
\begin{equation*}
\begin{split}
 E\big[\exp\{-\hat{R}_n(ct-\sum_{i=0}^{V_t^{(n)}}\xi_i)\}\big|\mathcal{F}_s\big]
