[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2609.03084, 'Convergence rates to traveling waves for an FKPP model with nonlinear advection'] Let $\eta$ be defined as in \eqref{profile_function}. Then
        \begin{equation}
            \eta + \chi A \in C^3(0, 1). 
