[Proposition 22 of arXiv:2604.18871, 'Quantitative approximation of the Vlasov(--Fokker--Planck)--Navier--Stokes system by stoch'] Let Assumptions~\ref{assump-PDE} and \ref{assump-particles} hold, with $\sigma > 0$.
