[Lemma lem:faulhaber of arXiv:2607.19844, 'Binomial probabilities at a fixed distance from the mode:\\ size-biasing and the complete '] For every $k\ge1$, every $h$ and every $r\in\mathbb Z$,
	\begin{equation}
		S_k(h,r)=\frac{B_{k+1}(h+r)-B_{k+1}(h)}{k+1},
		\qquad
