[Lemma lem:SylvesterFunctional of arXiv:2411.19163, '\bfseries Random polytopes in convex bodies:\\ Bridging the gap between extremal container'] For any ${\boldsymbol{\beta}}\in[0,\infty)^m$, any $\mathbf{w}=(v_1\mathbf{u}_1,\ldots,v_m\mathbf{u}_m)$ with $\mathbf{u}_i\in\mathbb{S}^{d_i-1}$ and $\mathbf{v}\in\mathbb{S}^{m}_+$, and for any $s\in(\max\{0,s_1(\mathbf{v})\},\|\mathbf{v}\|_1)$ we have
    \begin{equation*}
       0< C_{\operatorname{bd},{\boldsymbol{\beta}}}\leq  G(\mathbf{w},s) \leq 1.
    \end{equation*}

