        \liminf_{q\to\infty} \mathbb{W}_1\big(Law(X^{\kappa_{2q}}_1(x)),Law(X^{\kappa_{2q+1}}_1(x))\big) \geq \tilde c_\eps >0.
    \end{equation*}

