[Lem lem gamma of arXiv:2411.01847, 'Well-Posedness of Stochastic Chemotaxis System'] Assuming $g$ satisfies ((g of the paper)) with $\mu > \frac{\chi}{2}$, for $p_0 \in (2, \frac{\chi}{(\chi-\mu)^+})$, there exists a constant $C_{p_0,\|u_0\|_\infty} > 0$ such that for all $T > 0$, the following inequality holds:
