which, by hypothesis, implies that $g^{\tilde{L}}_v(\widetilde{\nabla}^v f,\widetilde{\nabla}^v f) \leq 1$ for each $v\in TM\setminus 0$.  Therefore, $\tilde{L}$ is complete by Corollary~(CorC of the","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:a1080ef7b51b1720a347d3a86d04c689e5ecfa41f54952be9d9b872b1a386313","revision_digest":"sha256:fe6bd9641ebf24046be1257d8282aba9d1f8cafddde32f36ba9c5cca166a2fb4","source_id":"arxiv:2609.03909","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

